# Every text file is LF in every checkout, Windows included (2026-11-11).
# A checkout that converts line endings changes bytes the build hashes or
# embeds: sqlx checksums each migration's file, and a Windows build made from
# a CRLF checkout recorded checksums no Mac or Linux build accepts
# (`crates/knobas-db/src/migrate.rs`, *Line endings*). `text=auto` leaves a
# file git sees as binary alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Named as well: the files sqlx hashes stay LF whatever becomes of the line above.
crates/knobas-db/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
crates/knobas-db/migrations.sha384 text eol=lf

# The live seed uploads these and compares them byte for byte (#2410).
testenv/jira-attachments/** binary
